# Must be IDENTICAL to the JWT_SECRET used by the quarc-auth service (see
# Quarc_Notes/auth/.env) and by Quarc Music's and Quarc Notes' .env — that's
# what makes one login work across every Quarc app, and what lets this app
# read a session cookie issued by quarc-auth.
JWT_SECRET=change-this-to-a-long-random-string
